#: wallace_wall/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "WALL"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/WallaceQuestion/0/12
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "All right Wallace... have you heard anything about a counterfeit item in the house?"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/WallaceQuestion/0/28
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "WALL!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/WallaceQuestion/0/36
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Thank you, Wallace. You can go."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/WallaceQuestion/0/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I should have known."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/WallaceQuestion/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It was worth a try!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/WallaceQuestion/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Back to it then."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/SpecialWallaceQuestion/0/0
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Hello, warrior companion!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/SpecialWallaceQuestion/0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Oh! He speaks!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/SpecialWallaceQuestion/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't worry, Wallace, she's a good one."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/SpecialWallaceQuestion/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maggie... would you mind leaving us here?"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/SpecialWallaceQuestion/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Very well."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/SpecialWallaceQuestion/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Sure... have fun you two..."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/SpecialWallaceQuestion/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Have you heard anything about a counterfeit item in the house?"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/SpecialWallaceQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "A few days ago, while I was making my rounds in the exercise room..."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/SpecialWallaceQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "I overheard someone say that the silverware is not what it seems to be - that it is actually fake silver!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/SpecialWallaceQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The exercise room, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/SpecialWallaceQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "That's right!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/SpecialWallaceQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "The crucible in which we temper the steel of our indomitable strength and fortitude."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/SpecialWallaceQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/26
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "The rumor has penetrated even this sanctum of our discipline."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/SpecialWallaceQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you recall who it was specifically?"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/SpecialWallaceQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "As a matter of fact I do."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/SpecialWallaceQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/34/c-0/15
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "It was Stepford. I don't believe he meant any harm by it, though."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/SpecialWallaceQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/34/c-0/29
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "If I were to hazard a guess, he most likely heard it from someone else and was simply repeating it."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/SpecialWallaceQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/34/c-0/37
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "He has no discipline, that boy."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/SpecialWallaceQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/34/c-0/45/b/1
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Thanks, Wallace. You've really helped us out!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/SpecialWallaceQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/34/c-0/48
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "We must support our comrades when they require our aid."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "How does one even describe a warrior like this? A veritable, well, <i>wall</i> of muscle stands before you. It's almost comforting to know the walls of your house are <i>this</i> solid."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/11 wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/c-1/15/g-0/0 wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/0 wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/8 wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/c-2/24/b/1 wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/c-2/25/b/1 wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/c-2/26/b/1 wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/c-2/27/b/1 wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/c-2/28/b/1 wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/c-2/29/b/1 wallace_wall/wallace_realized_wall/0/wallacejoin2/49
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Wall."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/19
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Wall. Wall."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/30
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Wall. Wall. Wall!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hello!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/45/s/0 wallace_wall/hate_path/0/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/46/s/0 wallace_wall/wall_true_love_return/0/8/s/0 wallace_wall/wall_true_friend_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wall!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What the literal fuck."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/c-0/7 wallace_wall/wallace_realize_begin/33 wallace_wall/wallace_realize_begin_wall/22 wallace_wall/wallace_realized_wall/0/0 wallace_wall/wallace_realized_wall/0/wallacejoin2/36
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Wall!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How are you?"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/c-0/18/c-0/7 wallace_wall/wallace_realize_wall_join/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Wall wall wall!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/c-0/18/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you just repeating what I'm saying but with 'wall'?"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Wall...."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay... sure."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This makes perfect sense."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/c-1/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This one? I hate this."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/c-1/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Wall wall."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The warrior's eyes widen. He leans in closer, towering over you."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "... wall?"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/c-2/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wall... wall!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/c-2/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wall wall wall!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/c-2/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Whatever you're saying here is clearly pleasing to him. He nods, beginning to smile."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/c-2/26/c-0/15
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Wall. Wall!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/c-2/26/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He throws his head back in a belly laugh that echoes through the house."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/c-2/26/c-1/15
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Ha ha ha wall!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He beams at you, a flush spreading across his cheeks."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "I LOVE YOU!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "WALL!!!!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/g-0/42
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He... oh. That was sudden, wasn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/g-0/50
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Ahem. You and Wallace, who has only just introduced himself to you, are now lovers. His gaze settles on you, filled with tenderness."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/g-0/58
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "His drywall heart beats only for you. You live happily ever after."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_intro/0/g-0/66
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Yes, just that quickly."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure. Yes. Of course. Love it."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No. I don't like this."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "WALLLLL!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wall."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm ready to Realize you, Wallace!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Haha! Wallwall!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Mmm.... wall..... wa..."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/c-2/25/b/9 wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/c-2/26/b/9 wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/c-2/27/b/9 wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/c-2/28/b/12 wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/c-2/29/b/12
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He remains saying 'Wall.'"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/c-2/26/b/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Though was there a touch of a smile this time?"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/c-2/27/b/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Yet this time you could feel some positivity radiating from his being."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/c-2/28/b/17
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's undoubtable. This is starting to have an effect."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wallace_love_return/0/c-2/29/b/17
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But this time... he shifts. Is this a test?"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_off/0/0
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Wall. Wall. Wall. Wall!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_off/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wall?"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_off/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Walllll!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_off/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Walllll!!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_off/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Walll! Walll!! Walll!!!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_off/0/c-0/15/c-0/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wallllll!!!!!!!!!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/wall_off/0/c-0/15/c-0/21/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Man I feel so dumb doing this."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/hate_path/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Wallace looks at you with true pain in his eyes, shaking his head slowly."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/hate_path/0/8
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "No...."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/hate_path/0/19 wallace_wall/friend_path/0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You're stunned to hear him speaking in words you understand."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/hate_path/0/27
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Cracked. Broken..."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/hate_path/0/35
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "I was not uplifted. Not strengthened."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/hate_path/0/43
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Shattered."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/hate_path/0/51
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Gone."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/hate_path/0/60/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't believe this."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/hate_path/0/g-0/3
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "What we had was excellent. Beautiful, even."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/hate_path/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "When I heard you sing the words with the proper support, I thought I found a true friend."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/hate_path/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Tch."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/hate_path/0/g-0/30
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "How easily we break."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/hate_path/0/g-0/69
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You cracked the wall!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/hate_path/0/g-0/80
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Not bad. That took some skill."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/hate_path/0/g-0/88
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Honestly, it's kinda hot."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/4
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "You understand me. You speak the words of the foretellers."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes! Yes you can talk!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I... yep. Totally meant to do that."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Of course I can talk."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why didn't you before?"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-0/15/1/s/0 wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't believe this. I thought you were like one of those pocket-sized monsters that can only say their name..."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "I was on Duty. Keeping the Home constantly aloft is taxing and requires great resolve."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Hearing you speak the Cry like that allowed me to relax with the knowledge that there is someone else here as strong as I."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/0/s/0 wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's the Cry?"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/7 wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-1/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "I give the cry of the Wall to remind me of my Duty!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/15 wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-0/15/c-1/26/g-0/0 wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-1/31/c-0/15 wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-1/31/c-1/26/g-0/0
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "I choose to uphold the prophecy. To keep the Strong. To keep the Warm."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/26 wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-0/15/c-1/26/g-0/11 wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-1/31/c-0/26 wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-1/31/c-1/26/g-0/11
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "And abhor the Crack."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-0/15/c-1/7 wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-1/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "No. I am a Defender. One of the tribe of the buttress."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-0/15/c-1/15 wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-1/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Many of my brothers have fallen. Many of my sisters have Cracked. It is up to me here to keep the prophecy alive and upright."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-0/15/c-1/26/0/s/0 wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-1/31/c-1/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So, not like a little monster guy then."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-0/15/c-1/26/1/s/0 wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-1/31/c-1/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's so cool and maybe honorable!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Wallace places a massive, firm hand on your shoulder, giving you a kind smile."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "I see your little stumble of words. It is all right if you knew not what you were doing."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "What mattered is that you had the strength to carry out the Cry."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/crackjoin/3
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "I am painted with any color you wish. Art is nailed through my body."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/crackjoin/11
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "It all glances off me like so many childish blows. It is my duty."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/crackjoin/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're a pretty fascinating individual."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/crackjoin/c-2/7
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "I am a mere foot soldier. Nothing more."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/crackjoin/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I understand. As am I, in a way."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path/0/crackjoin/c-2/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's pretty hot, actually."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_2/0/0
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "You are as well? My liege, I live to serve you to lift Ceiling from Floor."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_2/0/8
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "But to hear that my Master is a soldier is truly surprising to this humble servant."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_2/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, I guess you could compare customer service to a war."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_2/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ah, not really. I just wanted to sound cool in front of such a stud."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Fascinating! Tell me more."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_2/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "You speak of the Studs?"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_2/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "They are quite strong. So strong that they repel any sort of piercing attack."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_2/0/c-1/29
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "I am a mere bulwark. They are my final defense."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_2/0/c-1/40/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was calling you a stud - a real nice hunk of wall."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_3/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Customer service is about helping people with problems they have."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_3/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "As a human every day is a battle to keep everything from falling apart at the seams."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_3/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "The Constant Creak of Strain. You must separate Floor from Ceiling!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_3/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I keep customers from vendors... in theory."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_3/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Fie on these Customers! Hail Vendors!"
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_3/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Yes! That Strain. That constant worry. I feel it too."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_3/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Our forebears have kept our races going for thousands of years. Humans and Walls. Floors and Ceilings. Since the dawn of Rain and Snow."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_3/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Long have I heard your chatter around my Walls."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_3/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "And yet never have I put together that we are in fact comrades-in-arms."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_3/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Brave. And true."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_3/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Brave. And true."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_3/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The way you talk... it's so attractive."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_3/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "I will call you Friend."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_3/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "I do not call many Friend."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_3/0/g-0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "The Art. The Floor. The Ceiling."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_3/0/g-0/c-2/31
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "These are my Companions."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_3/0/g-0/c-2/39
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "But you."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_3/0/g-0/c-2/47
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Are a Friend."
msgstr ""

#: wallace_wall/friend_path_love/0/4
msgctxt "Wallace"
